{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, take it, identify it, perform task or scan area for new objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectIdentified    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
